msgid "&Taskbar"
msgstr "Kasbar"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid "&Show windows from all desktops"
msgstr "Vertoon vensters van alle werkskerms"

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the taskbar to display all of the existing "
"windows at once. By default, the taskbar will only show those windows that "
"are on the current desktop."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie opsie as jy wil hê die kasbar na vertoon alle van die "
"bestaande vensters na as eers. Deur verstek, die kasbar sal slegs vertoon "
"daardie vensters wat word op die huidige werkskerm."

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "Show window list &button"
msgstr "Vertoon venster lys knoppie"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the taskbar to display a small popup which "
"gives you easy access to all applications on other desktops and some further "
"options."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie opsie as jy wil hê die kasbar na vertoon 'n klein opspring "
"wat gee jy maklike toegang verkry na alle programme op ander werkskerms en "
"sommige verdere opsies."

#: rc.cpp:7
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sort tas&ks by virtual desktop"
msgstr "Sorteer take deur virtuele werkskerm"

#: rc.cpp:8
#, fuzzy
msgid "Check this option if you want the taskbar to sort task buttons by desktop."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie opsie as jy wil hê die kasbar na sorteer opdrag knoppies "
"deur werkskerm."

#: rc.cpp:9
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sho&w application icons"
msgstr "Vertoon aansoek ikoone"

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid "Check this option if you want to display the applications icon in the taskbar"
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie opsie as jy wil hê na vertoon die programme ikoon in die "
"kasbar"

#: rc.cpp:11
#, fuzzy
msgid "Show o&nly minimized windows"
msgstr "Vertoon slegs geïkonifiseer vensters"

#: rc.cpp:12
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the taskbar to display only windows which are "
"minimized. By default, the taskbar will show all windows."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie opsie as jy wil hê die kasbar na vertoon slegs vensters "
"wat word geïkonifiseer. Deur verstek, die kasbar sal vertoon alle vensters."

#: rc.cpp:13
#, fuzzy
msgid "&Group similar tasks:"
msgstr "Groep soortgelyk take:"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the taskbar to hold all running instances of "
"one application in one taskbutton. Clicking on the button for some seconds "
"will unfold a menu which shows all instances of the application. This is "
"especially useful with the \"<strong>Show all windows</strong>\" option."
msgstr ""
"Bevestig hierdie opsie as jy wil hê die kasbar na hou alle wat loop "
"instansies van een aansoek in een taak knoppie. Te kliek op die knoppie vir "
"sommige sekondes sal oop vou 'n kieslys wat vertoon alle instansies van die "
"aansoek. hierdie is in besonder bruikbare met die \"<strong>Vertoon alle "
"vensters</strong>\" opsie."

